message: >-
  If you use this repository for research or education, please cite this
  software and the original ACRF-RNN paper listed in references.
title: >-
  TA-ACRF-RNN: Distributed Graph-Based Financial Fraud Detection
  with Time-Aware Attention-based CRF and NebulaGraph
type: software
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-09-09"
repository-code: "https://github.com/2nguyen3/financial-fraud-detection-ta-acrf-rnn"
license: MIT
authors:
  - family-names: "Nguyen"
    given-names: "Tran Thao Nguyen"
    affiliation: "University of Information Technology, VNU-HCM"
  - family-names: "Nguyen"
    given-names: "Thuy Ngan"
    affiliation: "University of Information Technology, VNU-HCM"
keywords:
  - financial fraud detection
  - time-series analysis
  - attention mechanism
  - conditional random field
  - distributed database
  - PostgreSQL
  - NebulaGraph
  - Apache Spark
abstract: >-
  This project reproduces and extends the ACRF-RNN model introduced at IJCAI
  2025. TA-ACRF-RNN adds time-aware inter-company relations and integrates an
  Apache Spark processing pipeline with PostgreSQL and NebulaGraph components
  for distributed storage, querying, and analysis of company risk relations.
